        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-01-14T13:43:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The environment chain turn honestly wasn't that bad. I weathered it just fine and came out the other end battered but victorious.</p>\n<p>It's easy to get Mr. Fixer set up and feed him Links so he can Jack Handle everything constantly. That's... pretty much all you need to do, I think. I wasn't expecting to have such an easy time with this one, but it was fun!&nbsp;:D</p>",
