        "created_at": "2020-01-15T12:08:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint at 8/15/12/9. Fixer got set up early with Jack Handle + Riveting Crane + Harmony, and went to town. Got a lot of mileage out of self damage from Jump Scare, Fright Train's incap, and Compulsion Canister. Never did see Love Interest, but I melted Ermine down first.</p>",
